{"id":"b24fa26209f44674","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-base-free-variable.md","title":"Base Free-Variable Functions","display":"df-base-free-variable — Base Free-Variable Functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-base-free-variable","aliases":["90-df-base-free-variable"],"display":"df-base-free-variable — Base Free-Variable Functions","depends_on":["[[90-df-base-formula]]","[[90-df-term]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-base-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-base-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-base-free-variable — Base Free-Variable Functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"695f658f5cc56144\" href=\"?note=695f658f5cc56144\" title=\"90-df-base-formula\">90-df-base-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"242d776aa7405493\" href=\"?note=242d776aa7405493\" title=\"90-df-term\">90-df-term</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Lang}(\\Lambda)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ge1\">\\(r\\ge1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_r\">\\(f\\in F_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_r\">\\(R\\in R_r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\">\\(\\vec t\\in(\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda)^r\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>两个函数都按有限树结构递归；输出为变量符号的有限集合，不是数值变量代码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(x())&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(c())\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(s)\\cup\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\quad|\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)|&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\quad|\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)|&lt;\\infty.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(x())&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(c())\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Var}^{88}_\\Lambda),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(s)\\cup\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;r}\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\neg\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi\\land\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\cup\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\forall x\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\quad|\\operatorname{var}^{88}_\\Lambda(t)|&lt;\\infty,\\\\\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{88}_\\Lambda&amp;\\quad|\\operatorname{free}^{88}_\\Lambda(\\varphi)|&lt;\\infty.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件依据第 90 本实际调用的接口补齐未提供的外部依赖，供本书内部使用；不声称复原未提供的外部原文。 原 90-df-free-variable 保留其 FV 别名接口，本文件只补齐它所引用的递归来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-base-formula","status":"resolved","id":"695f658f5cc56144","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-base-formula]]","embed":false